{"unit_id":"JayCRL__MobileVC#card-zh","repo":"JayCRL/MobileVC","commit":"a3c6b36fa3a72bdddd849bc4a0d4c052f268c3ce","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"MobileVC（DSH 插件，手机 PWA）：把 DSH Web 的真实会话带到手机浏览器，直接复用宿主 sessionController。它提供实时思考与工具执行流、文本及图片/文件消息、队列修改和插话、手机审批与问题回答，还能浏览工作区文件、管理插件及查看后台任务。用户可在移动端继续跟进电脑上运行的 DSH 会话；Web Push 可提示任务结束或等待审批。需要一台已运行 DSH Web 的主机，插件本身不要求额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.mjs:737-747","plugin/index.mjs:1156-1206","plugin/index.mjs:1270-1353","plugin/index.mjs:1398-1407","plugin/index.mjs:1723-1743"]}
{"unit_id":"JayCRL__MobileVC#card-en","repo":"JayCRL/MobileVC","commit":"a3c6b36fa3a72bdddd849bc4a0d4c052f268c3ce","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"MobileVC is a mobile PWA for following DSH Web sessions. It streams agent output, sends messages and attachments, handles approvals, browses files and manages plugins through the host session controller. Optional Web Push reports turn completion. Requires a running DSH Web host.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.mjs:737-747","plugin/index.mjs:1156-1206","plugin/index.mjs:1270-1353","plugin/index.mjs:1398-1407","plugin/index.mjs:1723-1743"]}
