{"unit_id":"JayCRL__MobileVC#feature-live-session","repo":"JayCRL/MobileVC","commit":"a3c6b36fa3a72bdddd849bc4a0d4c052f268c3ce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"MobileVC 的功能「会话与实时执行流」：读取真实 DSH 会话及历史，并通过 SSE follow 显示新消息、思考和工具调用；在手机端切换会话继续查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.mjs:939-947","plugin/index.mjs:1398-1463","preview/app-live.js:130-210","preview/app-live.js:332-398"]}
{"unit_id":"JayCRL__MobileVC#feature-compose","repo":"JayCRL/MobileVC","commit":"a3c6b36fa3a72bdddd849bc4a0d4c052f268c3ce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"MobileVC 的功能「发送消息与附件」：在会话中发送文本、图片或文件，也能选择排队或立即插话；图片作为 image part，文件先经宿主上传服务取得 receipt。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.mjs:1156-1206","preview/app-live.js:1300-1338","preview/app-live.js:1362-1425"]}
{"unit_id":"JayCRL__MobileVC#feature-approval","repo":"JayCRL/MobileVC","commit":"a3c6b36fa3a72bdddd849bc4a0d4c052f268c3ce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"MobileVC 的功能「审批与问题回答」：收到待处理的工具授权或结构化问题后，可在手机上允许一次、拒绝或提交答案；超时后交回宿主后续处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.mjs:1270-1353","plugin/index.mjs:1588-1715","preview/app-live.js:1571-1625","preview/app-live.js:1627-1669"]}
